WEBVTT

01:38.210 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 35]

01:44.720 --> 01:47.900
♫The beginning of love♫

01:52.240 --> 01:54.440
♫The return is yet unknown♫

01:53.640 --> 01:54.310
Banxia,

01:54.640 --> 01:55.900
have you ever wondered

01:55.990 --> 01:57.350
what your life would be like

01:57.350 --> 01:58.880
if you couldn't see demons?

01:59.670 --> 02:02.700
♫Through endless days and nights♫

02:00.350 --> 02:02.480
Maybe things would be a little easier.

02:02.790 --> 02:05.040
I'd be closer to my family,

02:05.310 --> 02:06.950
go to school,

02:07.060 --> 02:09.509
♫Where my heart leads me to♫

02:07.120 --> 02:08.280
learn to ride horses,

02:08.280 --> 02:09.880
and even study martial arts.

02:10.479 --> 02:11.780
Isn't that He Quelian?

02:13.190 --> 02:14.650
You want that kind of life?

02:14.910 --> 02:15.560
Not really.

02:15.000 --> 02:21.760
♫Who is talking about never letting go of the memory♫

02:16.840 --> 02:17.400
Because that way,

02:17.400 --> 02:19.000
I'd never be able to meet you.

02:22.410 --> 02:29.250
♫Dreaming about the intertwined joy and sorrow♫

02:29.950 --> 02:37.220
♫Who knows the river of life winds through with twists and turns♫

02:38.090 --> 02:44.000
♫A fleeting memory, yet love endures♫

02:43.520 --> 02:44.310
What's going on?

02:44.310 --> 02:45.310
W-What happened?

02:45.630 --> 02:46.240
My Lady.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.970
Should we call for a physician?

02:48.470 --> 02:49.310
What's going on?

02:49.310 --> 02:51.040
She pulled her out of the river.

02:51.670 --> 02:53.340
[Xingxian]

02:51.860 --> 02:52.790
She's waking up.

02:53.120 --> 02:53.590
She's alive.

02:53.590 --> 02:54.320
She's alive.

02:56.030 --> 02:56.760
She's awake.

02:57.510 --> 02:58.240
She's awake.

02:59.420 --> 03:00.350
Are you alright?

03:00.960 --> 03:01.890
Are you alright?

03:02.630 --> 03:03.120
Go away!

03:04.360 --> 03:05.290
Go away, go away!

03:05.360 --> 03:05.890
Go away.

03:06.890 --> 03:07.960
You stupid woman!

03:08.000 --> 03:08.870
Stupid woman!

03:08.910 --> 03:09.590
What are you doing?

03:09.590 --> 03:10.370
Why did you kick her?

03:10.370 --> 03:13.370
[Zhang Pu]

03:10.610 --> 03:11.470
I just scolded you a little,

03:11.470 --> 03:12.840
and you tried to kill yourself.

03:12.840 --> 03:14.170
Why are you still alive?

03:14.680 --> 03:15.610
Are you alright?

03:15.710 --> 03:16.040
Come.

03:16.470 --> 03:17.470
Come home with me!

03:17.870 --> 03:18.750
You can't take her!

03:18.750 --> 03:19.410
Be careful.

03:21.570 --> 03:22.410
You again.

03:23.079 --> 03:24.280
Who are you to step in?

03:25.240 --> 03:26.900
I'm disciplining my own wife.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.310
What's it to you?

03:29.270 --> 03:30.000
Come with me!

03:30.190 --> 03:30.560
Don't

03:30.560 --> 03:31.820
embarrass me further!

03:33.630 --> 03:34.230
Well done!

03:34.280 --> 03:34.880
Well done!

03:36.090 --> 03:37.820
Your wife isn't embarrassing.

03:38.310 --> 03:39.870
The one who's truly embarrassing

03:39.870 --> 03:40.470
is you,

03:40.470 --> 03:42.270
a lazy, good-for-nothing fool!

03:43.960 --> 03:45.310
Touch her again,

03:45.310 --> 03:45.750
and I swear

03:45.750 --> 03:47.430
I'll drag you to the authorities.

03:47.430 --> 03:49.430
Take him to the authorities!

03:49.470 --> 03:50.560
The authorities?

03:51.720 --> 03:52.750
Do you even know where

03:52.750 --> 03:54.210
the government office is?

03:55.000 --> 03:56.590
You little wench,

03:56.840 --> 03:58.300
you think you can scare me?

03:58.360 --> 03:59.000
Try me,

03:59.030 --> 04:00.160
and you'll find out.

04:01.810 --> 04:03.020
I can tell you this:

04:03.470 --> 04:05.590
my dad works at the government office.

04:05.590 --> 04:07.810
I know all the constables there very well.

04:07.810 --> 04:08.630
If you don't believe me,

04:08.630 --> 04:09.750
just come with me.

04:10.470 --> 04:12.150
When you're in jail,

04:12.520 --> 04:13.360
we'll see if you

04:13.360 --> 04:14.470
still dare to act out

04:14.470 --> 04:15.530
and beat your wife.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.660
Put him in jail!

04:16.680 --> 04:17.540
Put him in jail!

04:17.740 --> 04:18.240
That's right.

04:18.240 --> 04:18.800
Have him arrested.

04:18.800 --> 04:19.269
That's right.

04:19.269 --> 04:19.720
Have him arrested.

04:19.720 --> 04:20.390
Have him arrested.

04:20.390 --> 04:21.050
Report him.

04:28.870 --> 04:29.680
Out of my way!

04:30.000 --> 04:31.360
Move aside!

04:32.360 --> 04:33.340
Get lost.

04:36.430 --> 04:37.240
Miss Duan.

04:38.190 --> 04:38.750
This isn't

04:38.750 --> 04:40.350
the first time he's hurt you.

04:41.420 --> 04:42.950
I helped you once, twice,

04:43.070 --> 04:44.000
but I can't

04:44.000 --> 04:45.130
be there every time.

04:45.430 --> 04:47.390
If you always wait for someone to save you,

04:47.390 --> 04:48.390
what will you do

04:48.390 --> 04:49.520
when no one shows up?

04:52.310 --> 04:53.430
Not every time will someone

04:53.430 --> 04:54.000
appear

04:54.020 --> 04:55.480
to be your guardian angel.

05:00.630 --> 05:02.560
My Lady, you got into a fight again.

05:02.610 --> 05:03.270
If Madam finds out,

05:03.270 --> 05:04.480
she'll be furious.

05:04.870 --> 05:05.750
Ms. Xingxian

05:05.750 --> 05:07.150
is really quite foolish.

05:07.600 --> 05:07.950
You've

05:07.950 --> 05:09.390
helped her so many times,

05:10.040 --> 05:11.830
yet she'd rather stay and get beaten

05:11.830 --> 05:12.920
than leave her husband

05:12.920 --> 05:14.720
to seek a better life elsewhere.

05:15.370 --> 05:16.250
If you ask me,

05:16.510 --> 05:18.040
even if you help her 10,000 times,

05:18.040 --> 05:19.310
if she remains weak-willed,

05:19.310 --> 05:20.770
it won't change anything.

05:23.670 --> 05:24.430
My Lady,

05:25.210 --> 05:25.920
are you even

05:25.920 --> 05:26.870
listening to me?

05:28.960 --> 05:29.560
Tingzhou.

05:30.680 --> 05:32.610
When I went into the river earlier,

05:33.210 --> 05:34.300
did you hear

05:34.460 --> 05:36.020
a man's voice on the bank?

05:36.940 --> 05:39.310
There were so many people on the bank at that time,

05:39.310 --> 05:40.630
both men and women.

05:40.659 --> 05:42.590
My Lady, who are you talking about?

05:49.950 --> 05:50.560
My Lady,

05:51.720 --> 05:53.180
what exactly did you hear?

05:54.070 --> 05:55.400
I didn't hear anything.

05:57.090 --> 05:57.480
My Lady,

05:57.480 --> 05:59.740
you must have had hallucinations again.

06:01.230 --> 06:03.490
If you ask me, this is all Master's fault.

06:03.980 --> 06:05.510
You were already frightened

06:05.510 --> 06:07.970
by the Human-faced Owl at the Nanyang house.

06:08.390 --> 06:09.650
Now here in Guangping,

06:09.800 --> 06:11.040
before resting for a few days,

06:11.040 --> 06:12.440
we're busy moving again.

06:13.570 --> 06:14.130
Now look—

06:14.870 --> 06:17.730
your body's weak, and the hallucinations are back.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.510
Alright,

06:19.990 --> 06:21.360
my clothes are almost dry.

06:21.360 --> 06:21.950
Let's go.

06:24.870 --> 06:26.240
Take a look! Take a look!

06:27.160 --> 06:29.830
Big and sweet pears!

06:31.750 --> 06:32.750
Their pears

06:32.950 --> 06:34.080
are sweet and crisp.

06:34.710 --> 06:36.230
When Ji Li was still here,

06:36.020 --> 06:38.240
[Xu Zhizhi, Yunmen Dance Troupe Dancer]

06:36.390 --> 06:37.120
she often came with me

06:37.120 --> 06:38.070
to buy pears from them.

06:38.070 --> 06:38.360
Sir,

06:38.390 --> 06:38.830
a catty of this.

06:38.830 --> 06:39.600
It's full.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.250
Can you hold this for me?

06:42.360 --> 06:43.720
I'd like a catty of this.

06:43.720 --> 06:44.310
Alright!

06:44.720 --> 06:45.780
Tingzhou, pay her.

06:48.510 --> 06:48.920
Here.

06:49.159 --> 06:49.920
Thank you.

06:50.270 --> 06:51.070
It's nothing.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.270
Take this pear.

06:53.870 --> 06:54.800
It's very sweet.

06:55.630 --> 06:56.240
Take it.

06:58.680 --> 06:59.880
I'll give you one too.

07:00.800 --> 07:01.480
Thank you.

07:02.870 --> 07:03.510
Miss,

07:03.720 --> 07:04.380
your herbs.

07:05.360 --> 07:05.960
Thank you.

07:06.200 --> 07:06.730
Let's go.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.070
Let me take it.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.120
Dad,

07:11.480 --> 07:12.360
here's the cinnamon.

07:12.290 --> 07:14.340
[Jiu Cangming
Jiu Xi]

07:12.390 --> 07:13.600
Good, crush it all up.

07:14.000 --> 07:14.530
Alright.

07:14.890 --> 07:15.690
Just a moment.

07:24.430 --> 07:26.030
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law?

07:27.280 --> 07:28.750
What's in your basket?

07:28.900 --> 07:30.160
Something delicious?

07:30.160 --> 07:31.510
C-Can I have some?

07:33.390 --> 07:34.040
Could you help me

07:34.040 --> 07:35.300
take this to Uncle Jiu?

07:35.630 --> 07:36.310
And also,

07:36.430 --> 07:37.070
stop calling me

07:37.070 --> 07:38.670
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.

07:48.720 --> 07:49.610
This house

07:49.760 --> 07:50.990
is quite old.

07:51.850 --> 07:54.320
And with all the shops nearby,

07:54.770 --> 07:56.240
it is a bit noisy.

07:57.790 --> 07:59.000
A good house is easy to find,

07:59.000 --> 08:00.600
but good neighbors are rare.

08:01.730 --> 08:03.490
Back in Nanyang City,

08:04.000 --> 08:05.560
we ran into that dangerous

08:04.040 --> 08:08.290
[Mrs. Duan, Tang Ruyun]

08:05.560 --> 08:06.920
Human-faced Owl.

08:08.070 --> 08:09.530
Just thinking about it now

08:10.190 --> 08:11.450
still gives me chills.

08:12.830 --> 08:14.800
Only by living next to you

08:15.070 --> 08:16.870
can I feel a bit safer.

08:17.790 --> 08:21.180
[Mrs. Jiu, Hong Ning]

08:18.870 --> 08:19.630
Actually,

08:19.870 --> 08:22.480
I was scared too when I first married him.

08:23.380 --> 08:24.790
But gradually,

08:25.040 --> 08:26.120
I got used to it.

08:27.070 --> 08:28.070
You know,

08:28.270 --> 08:29.970
we can't let those things

08:30.000 --> 08:32.130
scare us from living our lives, right?

08:33.440 --> 08:34.270
I'm back!

08:35.510 --> 08:36.750
Banxia, come here.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.679
Greetings, Mrs. Jiu.

08:41.720 --> 08:43.030
Where have you been?

08:43.049 --> 08:44.370
Why are you all sweaty?

08:45.390 --> 08:46.120
Nowhere.

08:46.480 --> 08:47.940
I just went to see a friend.

08:50.030 --> 08:52.030
She's so reckless.

08:53.410 --> 08:54.200
I actually think

08:54.200 --> 08:56.120
Banxia has a lovely temperament.

08:57.630 --> 08:58.550
Is she engaged?

09:00.420 --> 09:02.280
We're looking for a match for her.

09:02.570 --> 09:04.210
If I recall, your son

09:04.240 --> 09:05.670
is also at the age of marriage,

09:05.670 --> 09:06.150
right?

09:07.000 --> 09:08.260
He's already engaged.

09:08.320 --> 09:10.650
They'll be married by the end of this year.

09:10.670 --> 09:11.470
That's great.

09:11.630 --> 09:12.510
He's engaged?

09:26.270 --> 09:26.910
My Lady,

09:26.910 --> 09:29.090
you must've skipped your medicine again.

09:29.090 --> 09:31.510
Or you wouldn't have had hallucinations again.

09:31.510 --> 09:33.030
Why were you so surprised

09:33.050 --> 09:33.390
that

09:33.390 --> 09:34.590
Mr. Jiu is engaged?

09:35.120 --> 09:37.000
The way you looked and talked today,

09:37.000 --> 09:38.150
anyone would think

09:38.150 --> 09:39.480
you're in love with him.

09:39.670 --> 09:40.600
In love.

09:41.080 --> 09:41.760
In love.

09:41.900 --> 09:42.620
In love.

09:43.600 --> 09:45.060
Stop mimicking nonsense.

09:47.000 --> 09:49.530
Fortunately, there were no outsiders there.

09:49.730 --> 09:50.530
If those words

09:50.550 --> 09:51.910
were twisted and spread around,

09:51.910 --> 09:52.270
people

09:52.270 --> 09:53.930
would gossip about you again.

09:54.080 --> 09:55.140
I'm not sick at all.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.320
I know.

09:57.440 --> 09:58.630
You're not sick.

09:59.750 --> 10:00.550
It's just that

10:00.780 --> 10:01.600
you occasionally

10:01.600 --> 10:02.460
talk nonsense,

10:02.480 --> 10:03.630
lack energy,

10:04.360 --> 10:05.080
and cry

10:05.080 --> 10:06.360
in your sleep.

10:08.870 --> 10:09.510
Still,

10:10.120 --> 10:10.740
your condition

10:10.740 --> 10:12.200
is a bit mysterious.

10:13.200 --> 10:13.750
For instance,

10:13.750 --> 10:14.930
back then, no one believed

10:14.930 --> 10:16.130
the bride was a demon.

10:16.740 --> 10:17.880
Only you believed

10:17.910 --> 10:19.110
Uncle Jiu instantly.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.000
My Lady,

10:20.790 --> 10:22.630
how did you figure out

10:22.630 --> 10:23.870
the bride was a demon?

10:25.240 --> 10:26.370
I don't know either.

10:27.550 --> 10:29.920
When I saw Manniang,

10:30.040 --> 10:32.090
she just felt strangely familiar.

10:33.080 --> 10:34.790
I also felt fear

10:35.750 --> 10:37.120
and some…

10:38.960 --> 10:39.910
pity, maybe?

10:40.240 --> 10:40.960
My Lady,

10:41.540 --> 10:43.800
it was your first time meeting the bride.

10:44.000 --> 10:46.200
Where did all those feelings come from?

10:48.030 --> 10:48.600
Banxia.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.800
-Mom.
-Madam.

10:52.480 --> 10:53.870
This is from Mrs. Jiu.

10:56.400 --> 10:57.000
She said when you

10:57.000 --> 10:58.030
wake up from bad dreams at night,

10:58.030 --> 10:58.790
reading this

10:59.480 --> 11:00.810
can help calm your mind.

11:04.150 --> 11:04.840
Chi Xue!

11:05.150 --> 11:06.630
Come help me with something.

11:06.630 --> 11:07.320
Coming.

11:15.480 --> 11:17.750
May the heart remain in timeless serenity.

11:17.750 --> 11:20.120
Like clouds drifting, like rivers flowing.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.240
Face all

11:21.390 --> 11:22.650
without turning away.

11:22.670 --> 11:23.200
In peace,

11:23.240 --> 11:25.080
release desires that cloud the mind.

11:25.080 --> 11:28.680
For all things rise and fall, unite and part like the ebbing tide.

11:45.790 --> 11:46.750
Who are you?

11:55.150 --> 11:56.440
What's wrong with me?

12:16.690 --> 12:19.470
[Liushui Pavilion]

12:22.410 --> 12:24.960
[Chilian]

12:35.200 --> 12:35.870
Miss Duan.

12:39.110 --> 12:40.420
Ms. Xingxian.

12:43.410 --> 12:44.910
It's really you.

12:46.490 --> 12:47.950
If you hadn't sent me that invitation,

12:47.950 --> 12:49.550
I wouldn't have believed it.

12:51.440 --> 12:53.240
I've already divorced Zhang Pu.

12:53.270 --> 12:54.320
These days, I play the Qin

12:54.320 --> 12:55.450
at Liushui Pavilion

12:55.890 --> 12:56.690
as a way

12:56.720 --> 12:58.250
to make a living for myself.

12:58.270 --> 12:59.670
Congratulations!

13:00.550 --> 13:02.210
I have to thank you, Miss Duan.

13:02.470 --> 13:03.980
If you hadn't shaken me awake

13:03.980 --> 13:05.100
and helped me out,

13:05.630 --> 13:06.360
I wouldn't even be alive

13:06.360 --> 13:07.490
to play the Qin here.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.860
You're the one who made it happen.

13:10.240 --> 13:11.150
I've heard

13:11.150 --> 13:12.550
that the owner of Liushui Pavilion

13:12.550 --> 13:13.750
is a master of the Qin.

13:13.960 --> 13:14.870
Most musicians don't

13:14.870 --> 13:16.600
get the chance to perform here.

13:17.070 --> 13:17.980
The fact that you do

13:17.980 --> 13:19.840
means your skills are top-notch.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.650
Top-notch? Hardly.

13:22.990 --> 13:24.720
I hadn't touched a Qin in years.

13:26.100 --> 13:27.580
It's all thanks to Mr. Bai.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.000
He recommended me

13:29.000 --> 13:31.060
and even wrote a new piece just for me.

13:31.150 --> 13:33.030
That's how I found a place to stay.

13:34.510 --> 13:35.420
Mr. Bai?

13:37.200 --> 13:39.060
He's a renowned master of the Qin.

13:39.710 --> 13:41.400
Kind-hearted like you,

13:41.630 --> 13:43.240
he took pity on me for being all alone

13:43.240 --> 13:44.770
and helped me find this job.

13:46.360 --> 13:46.870
Great!

13:47.630 --> 13:50.670
Great! Great! Great!

13:51.910 --> 13:53.320
Miss Duan, it's my turn.

13:53.600 --> 13:54.860
We'll talk more later.

13:55.030 --> 13:55.830
Go ahead then.

14:27.360 --> 14:28.360
Hoto noodles!

14:28.870 --> 14:30.480
Hot Hoto noodles!

14:30.510 --> 14:31.910
Freshly made and sold!

14:47.630 --> 14:48.400
Waiter.

14:49.090 --> 14:50.010
Any seats left?

14:52.730 --> 14:53.200
Miss,

14:53.360 --> 14:54.720
why don't you order first?

14:54.720 --> 14:56.320
There's an empty seat there.

14:56.480 --> 14:57.010
Alright.

14:57.200 --> 14:59.360
One bowl of Hoto noodles, one stuffed lotus root,

14:59.360 --> 15:00.290
and a honey cake.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.020
Certainly!

15:01.480 --> 15:02.010
This way.

15:04.270 --> 15:05.530
Sir, are you finished?

15:05.910 --> 15:07.130
I'd like to settle the bill.

15:07.130 --> 15:07.870
Take care.

16:11.600 --> 16:12.400
Can I help you?

16:14.670 --> 16:15.490
Sorry.

16:17.600 --> 16:19.670
Have we met before?

16:21.030 --> 16:22.230
You must be mistaken.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.540
This is my first time in Guangping.

16:24.540 --> 16:25.470
I don't know you.

16:26.750 --> 16:27.390
Farewell.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.130
Think carefully.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.480
I don't know why,

16:31.480 --> 16:33.440
but you feel familiar to me.

16:33.960 --> 16:34.670
I'm Duan Banxia.

16:34.670 --> 16:36.600
Are you sure we haven't met before?

16:37.030 --> 16:37.840
Yes.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.320
Thank you, sir.

17:00.840 --> 17:02.510
You're very kind.

17:04.369 --> 17:06.720
Are you here for work,

17:07.069 --> 17:08.400
for business,

17:08.550 --> 17:10.010
or maybe to visit someone?

17:11.550 --> 17:12.890
Where are you staying?

17:13.160 --> 17:14.720
At an inn?

17:14.920 --> 17:16.680
Or at a friend's place?

17:19.310 --> 17:19.920
Sir,

17:20.160 --> 17:21.720
how long have you been in Guangping?

17:21.720 --> 17:23.240
Have you had a chance to look around?

17:23.240 --> 17:25.099
Is your foot not hurting anymore?

17:25.400 --> 17:25.960
It hurts.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.329
It really hurts.

17:28.069 --> 17:28.750
However,

17:29.000 --> 17:31.000
I have some great herbal oil at home.

17:31.030 --> 17:32.070
My neighbor, Physician Jiu

17:32.070 --> 17:34.000
from Ganshan Clinic, gave it to me.

17:34.160 --> 17:34.920
He is the best

17:34.960 --> 17:36.420
bonesetter in Guangping.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.600
My house is just up ahead.

17:41.960 --> 17:43.090
Thank you for today.

17:44.590 --> 17:45.200
You were

17:45.200 --> 17:47.160
heading back to your inn just now, right?

17:47.160 --> 17:48.520
The closest one nearby

17:48.550 --> 17:49.920
should be Jude Hotel.

17:50.030 --> 17:51.290
Are you staying there?

17:53.640 --> 17:55.200
It seems so.

17:57.950 --> 17:58.610
Here we are.

17:59.070 --> 18:05.210
[Qingche Hall]

18:12.350 --> 18:14.310
I still don't know your name.

18:16.110 --> 18:17.170
My name is Man Ying.

18:19.060 --> 18:20.550
Man Ying…

18:22.490 --> 18:24.880
Jingchu is home to many Miao descendants.

18:25.350 --> 18:27.610
The surname Man is a prominent one there.

18:27.790 --> 18:28.680
Are you

18:28.680 --> 18:30.080
from Jingchu?

18:34.640 --> 18:35.310
So, Mr. Man,

18:35.310 --> 18:37.640
how long will you be staying in Guangping?

18:38.750 --> 18:39.550
I'm leaving.

18:40.550 --> 18:42.140
When will you come again?

18:43.390 --> 18:44.230
I won't.

18:49.070 --> 18:49.830
For years,

18:50.080 --> 18:51.240
I've been having the same dream

18:51.240 --> 18:52.070
over and over.

18:52.770 --> 18:54.140
In my dream,

18:54.510 --> 18:55.720
there's a man.

18:56.110 --> 18:57.440
He's about your height

18:57.760 --> 18:58.630
and your build.

18:59.100 --> 19:00.200
But the fog's too thick.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.790
I can never see his face clearly.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.450
Every time I walk towards him,

19:03.480 --> 19:04.740
I wake up.

19:05.270 --> 19:06.440
Someone told me

19:06.830 --> 19:08.350
you can only dream about

19:08.760 --> 19:09.590
people or things

19:09.590 --> 19:11.030
you've seen before.

19:11.680 --> 19:13.290
So I've always wondered

19:13.720 --> 19:14.640
if he's someone

19:15.050 --> 19:16.900
I met long ago

19:17.590 --> 19:18.670
but forgot.

19:20.660 --> 19:21.530
When I saw you

19:21.560 --> 19:22.920
at the noodle shop just now,

19:22.920 --> 19:24.580
you felt strangely familiar.

19:25.920 --> 19:27.750
That's why I stopped you.

19:27.970 --> 19:29.400
I know

19:29.550 --> 19:30.790
this is a bit rude,

19:31.750 --> 19:33.550
but I have to ask again.

19:34.300 --> 19:36.640
Have you really never been to Guangping before?

19:36.640 --> 19:38.200
Have we really never met?

19:39.400 --> 19:40.070
No.

19:44.400 --> 19:45.080
I see.

19:48.680 --> 19:50.740
Thank you for carrying me home today.

19:52.790 --> 19:53.990
You're done talking?

19:54.720 --> 19:55.520
I'll be going.

20:00.960 --> 20:03.880
My Lady, who's that guy?

20:06.400 --> 20:07.160
My Lady,

20:07.790 --> 20:09.320
what happened to your foot?

20:19.510 --> 20:20.370
I remember you.

20:21.500 --> 20:22.760
What brought you here?

20:27.720 --> 20:29.050
Hoto noodles are ready!

20:29.290 --> 20:29.840
Chi Xue,

20:30.350 --> 20:32.110
you sure you can eat all this?

20:32.720 --> 20:34.120
Have you come into money?

20:34.360 --> 20:36.160
Physician Jiu gave you a salary?

20:37.080 --> 20:38.200
It's not like I'm not paying you.

20:38.200 --> 20:39.460
Why so many questions?

20:40.440 --> 20:41.370
Enjoy your meal.

20:44.790 --> 20:46.240
Last time at the Reunion Inn,

20:46.240 --> 20:47.400
the person who helped us fight the puppets

20:47.400 --> 20:48.460
was you, wasn't it?

20:49.200 --> 20:50.000
Face covered,

20:50.070 --> 20:51.110
wielding a curved blade,

20:51.110 --> 20:52.350
with one move, you shattered Feng Tian's sword

20:52.350 --> 20:53.080
into pieces.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.120
How did you recognize me?

20:57.080 --> 20:57.970
I smelled you

20:58.000 --> 20:59.400
from three streets away.

21:01.080 --> 21:01.680
Since when

21:01.680 --> 21:03.280
did your nose become so keen?

21:03.750 --> 21:04.480
Surprised?

21:04.920 --> 21:06.550
I've practiced the Five-Sense Technique.

21:06.550 --> 21:08.150
I learned it from a dog demon.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.480
My five senses are sharp,

21:09.480 --> 21:11.140
especially my sense of smell.

21:12.480 --> 21:13.070
Sir,

21:13.160 --> 21:13.900
don't add garlic, please.

21:13.900 --> 21:14.960
I don't eat garlic.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.790
Your nose is so sharp.

21:18.020 --> 21:19.270
It's more tasty with garlic.

21:19.270 --> 21:20.200
You're smiling.

21:20.200 --> 21:21.830
You're admitting it, aren't you?

21:21.830 --> 21:22.270
Here,

21:22.440 --> 21:23.240
eat some more.

21:29.920 --> 21:31.510
My master said you meant no harm

21:31.510 --> 21:33.510
and told me not to go looking for you.

21:34.480 --> 21:35.880
He took you as a disciple?

21:36.030 --> 21:36.550
Yes.

21:37.560 --> 21:38.550
Jiu Xi

21:38.640 --> 21:39.640
is good at numbers

21:39.960 --> 21:41.290
and a decent physician,

21:41.510 --> 21:43.370
but he's not cut out for fighting.

21:43.830 --> 21:45.000
That old man wants his skills

21:45.000 --> 21:46.210
to be passed down.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.310
So he took me in.

21:49.960 --> 21:50.960
But he said

21:51.160 --> 21:52.680
I'm just learning some basics.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.620
Not really the one to inherit his legacy.

21:54.620 --> 21:56.280
He needs to find someone else.

21:59.070 --> 22:00.670
But I don't think he ever can.

22:01.830 --> 22:02.510
Why?

22:04.260 --> 22:05.130
He has an image

22:05.160 --> 22:06.790
of an ideal successor in his mind.

22:06.790 --> 22:07.790
He wants someone

22:07.790 --> 22:08.640
exactly like that.

22:08.640 --> 22:10.750
He's too picky to find them.

22:15.550 --> 22:16.550
Take your time.

22:16.960 --> 22:17.400
Here,

22:17.750 --> 22:18.810
have this bowl too.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.500
I haven't eaten this much in ages.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.040
I've been so busy lately.

22:33.400 --> 22:34.260
Busy with what?

22:35.000 --> 22:36.460
Jiu Xi is getting married.

22:36.520 --> 22:37.680
The old man is planning to

22:37.680 --> 22:38.810
renovate the house.

22:39.880 --> 22:40.880
That's good news.

22:41.830 --> 22:43.090
Who is Jiu Xi marrying?

22:43.790 --> 22:45.720
The daughter of a herbal merchant on Gujing Street.

22:45.720 --> 22:46.790
The old man goes there a lot

22:46.790 --> 22:47.660
to buy herbs.

22:47.920 --> 22:49.380
Over time, they got close.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.860
His wife picked the match.

22:51.880 --> 22:53.410
Does Jiu Xi really like her?

22:54.310 --> 22:55.160
I don't know.

22:56.640 --> 22:57.790
But let me tell you,

22:58.240 --> 23:00.550
he's been acting a little silly lately.

23:01.510 --> 23:03.170
Sometimes when he's writing,

23:03.270 --> 23:04.440
he just starts smiling

23:04.440 --> 23:05.640
out of the blue.

23:06.310 --> 23:07.370
Looks kinda weird.

23:08.100 --> 23:09.120
I wonder if the bride

23:09.120 --> 23:10.120
will like him.

23:13.400 --> 23:14.000
Oh, right.

23:15.000 --> 23:16.260
Thank you for that day.

23:16.710 --> 23:17.640
Master said

23:17.680 --> 23:18.940
if you hadn't shown up,

23:19.240 --> 23:19.880
he and I alone

23:19.880 --> 23:21.640
might not have been able to stop all the puppets.

23:21.640 --> 23:22.790
If they had gotten loose,

23:22.790 --> 23:24.450
we'd have been in big trouble.

23:27.480 --> 23:29.140
From now on, you're my friend.

23:30.050 --> 23:30.680
Friend?

23:31.750 --> 23:32.210
Friend.

23:35.400 --> 23:37.240
Alright, friend.

23:38.030 --> 23:39.290
I'm heading home then.

23:41.590 --> 23:42.070
Wait.

23:48.110 --> 23:50.070
Sir, you're in good shape.

23:51.070 --> 23:51.870
Do I look good?

24:04.590 --> 24:05.160
Boss.

24:06.590 --> 24:07.250
No problem.

24:14.140 --> 24:18.160
[Clothes and Brocade]

24:19.310 --> 24:20.030
Thank you.

24:20.750 --> 24:21.750
You look so happy.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.850
Feeling hungry again?

24:29.920 --> 24:30.550
No,

24:30.960 --> 24:32.750
I just smelled grilled venison.

24:32.750 --> 24:33.810
It smells amazing.

24:34.200 --> 24:35.720
It's Master's favorite.

24:39.200 --> 24:39.920
Wait for me.

24:47.030 --> 24:48.490
You're such a kind person.

24:48.750 --> 24:49.410
From now on,

24:49.750 --> 24:50.810
you're my brother.

24:51.880 --> 24:52.940
Aren't we friends?

24:53.310 --> 24:55.040
Friends aren't this generous.

24:55.200 --> 24:57.000
You're family, a brother.

25:02.160 --> 25:02.750
I'm home.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.240
Go in.

25:33.640 --> 25:34.440
Chi Xue?

25:34.920 --> 25:36.250
Why are you back so late?

25:36.510 --> 25:37.900
Master, what are you looking for?

25:37.900 --> 25:38.740
I'm hungry.

25:39.930 --> 25:41.110
I swear there was a plate of fried beans left.

25:41.110 --> 25:42.400
Where is it?

25:46.510 --> 25:47.440
What's that smell?

25:47.440 --> 25:48.640
What are you holding?

25:49.680 --> 25:50.790
Grilled venison.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.110
Fresh off the grill.

25:52.110 --> 25:53.490
Your favorite, Master.

25:54.170 --> 25:55.570
Quick, quick, set it out!

25:56.350 --> 25:57.610
It's grilled venison!

25:59.680 --> 26:00.340
Wonderful!

26:00.400 --> 26:01.510
Dad, Chi Xue,

26:01.680 --> 26:02.720
what are you eating?

26:02.720 --> 26:04.510
Your nose is quite sharp, isn't it?

26:04.510 --> 26:05.160
Sit down.

26:05.160 --> 26:05.590
Join us.

26:05.590 --> 26:06.120
Alright.

26:09.790 --> 26:10.480
Eat up.

26:11.750 --> 26:12.830
This is so delicious.

26:12.830 --> 26:14.290
We have to eat it with wine.

26:14.400 --> 26:15.200
You're right.

26:15.480 --> 26:15.960
Go, go,

26:16.030 --> 26:17.590
bring out the good wine I've hidden.

26:17.590 --> 26:18.720
Okay, I'll go get it.

26:18.830 --> 26:19.490
Wait for me.

26:25.310 --> 26:26.550
Dad, the wine's here!

26:29.920 --> 26:31.400
Let's all keep our voices down.

26:31.400 --> 26:32.550
Don't wake your mom.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.270
Or we'll all get scolded.

26:34.270 --> 26:34.830
Okay.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.330
Let me fill your cup.

26:49.960 --> 26:50.440
Dad,

26:50.880 --> 26:52.410
you're playing favorites.

26:52.420 --> 26:53.640
You snuck Chi Xue pocket money,

26:53.640 --> 26:54.500
but none for me.

26:54.720 --> 26:56.160
Yesterday I wanted to buy a poetry book,

26:56.160 --> 26:57.110
but when I checked my pocket,

26:57.110 --> 26:58.070
I didn't have enough money.

26:58.070 --> 26:58.680
Nonsense!

26:59.360 --> 27:01.220
I didn't give Chi Xue any pocket money.

27:01.220 --> 27:02.820
Master didn't give me money.

27:02.830 --> 27:04.490
This was bought by my brother.

27:05.110 --> 27:05.910
Your brother?

27:06.440 --> 27:07.930
The one from last time at the Reunion Inn

27:07.930 --> 27:09.260
who used a curved blade.

27:09.720 --> 27:10.650
Didn't I tell you

27:11.000 --> 27:12.510
not to go to him?

27:12.720 --> 27:13.440
I didn't.

27:14.280 --> 27:15.480
He just happened to pass by

27:15.480 --> 27:17.270
from Manniang's Cousin-in-Law's place today.

27:17.270 --> 27:18.200
We ran into each other,

27:18.200 --> 27:19.160
so I said hi.

27:19.790 --> 27:21.480
Then he insisted on treating me to a meal.

27:21.480 --> 27:23.310
He even bought me a lot of new clothes.

27:23.310 --> 27:23.960
On the way back,

27:23.960 --> 27:26.090
he bought the grilled venison for you.

27:28.160 --> 27:28.850
Tell me,

27:28.880 --> 27:30.240
how come other demon hunters

27:30.240 --> 27:31.200
are all so rich,

27:31.790 --> 27:33.190
and we end up losing money

27:33.270 --> 27:34.600
every time we take a job?

27:35.720 --> 27:36.130
Dad,

27:36.680 --> 27:38.680
our clinic is barely breaking even.

27:39.590 --> 27:40.240
You brat,

27:40.510 --> 27:41.160
I'm saving up

27:41.160 --> 27:42.140
to get you a wife!

27:42.360 --> 27:43.350
I also gotta fix the backyard

27:43.350 --> 27:44.440
and patch up the roof.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.370
It's all for you.

27:45.590 --> 27:46.250
All for you.

27:46.550 --> 27:47.070
Go away.

27:47.550 --> 27:48.610
Let's have a toast.

27:48.920 --> 27:49.440
Here.

27:50.000 --> 27:51.330
I'll drink tea instead.

27:52.000 --> 27:52.930
Cheers, cheers.

28:07.850 --> 28:08.400
Banxia,

28:09.160 --> 28:10.090
I used to wonder,

28:10.290 --> 28:11.730
if we'd never met,

28:12.240 --> 28:14.170
what kind of life you'd have lived.

29:34.140 --> 29:35.250
Hurry up, Dad, Mom.

29:37.580 --> 29:38.100
Come.

29:42.590 --> 29:43.920
Dad, Mom,

29:43.940 --> 29:44.450
look.

29:44.680 --> 29:45.790
Is my bunny pretty?

29:45.790 --> 29:46.510
Yes.

29:47.890 --> 29:48.610
Be careful.

30:07.200 --> 30:07.790
Banxia,

30:08.080 --> 30:08.970
at school,

30:09.000 --> 30:10.830
you need to listen to your teacher, okay?

30:10.830 --> 30:11.890
Yes, Mom.

30:11.920 --> 30:12.960
When I come back, I'll recite

30:12.960 --> 30:14.240
what I've learned for you.

30:14.240 --> 30:14.680
Okay.

30:30.290 --> 30:31.490
Here, have a duck leg.

30:31.720 --> 30:32.240
More.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.610
Thank you, Mom and Dad.

30:35.060 --> 30:36.540
Mom, this one is for you.

30:36.960 --> 30:37.620
Banxia,

30:37.750 --> 30:39.030
I don't like to eat this.

30:39.030 --> 30:40.270
Your mom likes this.

30:40.750 --> 30:41.200
Here.

30:41.400 --> 30:42.200
I like it too.

30:43.270 --> 30:44.130
Eat more, okay?

31:36.310 --> 31:37.310
Dad, let me help you.

31:37.310 --> 31:37.710
Okay.

31:51.220 --> 31:54.740
♫Melody echoes along the river; wild geese soar in sudden fright♫

31:55.230 --> 31:57.910
♫The music ends, and I stand in solitude♫

31:59.550 --> 32:02.780
♫I see you turn into a handful of starlight♫

32:03.260 --> 32:07.090
♫Drifting past me♫

32:07.550 --> 32:11.340
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

32:11.700 --> 32:14.840
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

32:15.000 --> 32:19.590
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

32:19.980 --> 32:21.990
♫But why did you♫

32:22.300 --> 32:26.590
♫Still endure the pain and shatter?♫

32:26.930 --> 32:31.420
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

32:29.270 --> 32:30.640
I don't raise rabbits.

32:31.520 --> 32:35.200
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

32:31.960 --> 32:33.830
My name is Jiu Xuanye.

32:34.680 --> 32:36.310
I'm Duan Banxia.

32:35.480 --> 32:37.420
♫I hate that I failed♫

32:37.440 --> 32:42.760
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

32:43.140 --> 32:47.340
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

32:47.360 --> 32:52.230
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

32:53.000 --> 32:59.180
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

32:58.960 --> 33:00.090
I really do like you,

33:01.040 --> 33:01.680
but I don't know

33:01.680 --> 33:02.880
when it started.

33:04.510 --> 33:05.200
Maybe

33:06.000 --> 33:07.110
a long time ago.

33:16.660 --> 33:20.440
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

33:16.840 --> 33:17.480
But I can

33:17.510 --> 33:18.680
swear on my life,

33:19.480 --> 33:20.960
if you're willing to marry me,

33:20.800 --> 33:23.940
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

33:21.550 --> 33:23.280
I'll treat you with all my heart

33:23.550 --> 33:24.610
for the rest of my days.

33:24.100 --> 33:28.690
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

33:25.750 --> 33:27.920
No matter what dangers may come in the future,

33:27.920 --> 33:29.270
I will fight with my life

33:29.080 --> 33:31.090
♫But why did you♫

33:29.720 --> 33:30.640
to protect you.

33:31.400 --> 33:35.690
♫Still endure the pain and shatter?♫

33:36.030 --> 33:40.520
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

33:36.920 --> 33:37.380
Banxia.

33:38.550 --> 33:39.270
Forget me.

33:40.620 --> 33:44.300
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

33:44.580 --> 33:46.520
♫I hate that I failed♫

33:46.550 --> 33:51.870
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

33:52.240 --> 33:56.440
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

33:56.470 --> 34:01.330
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

33:57.070 --> 33:57.680
My Lady,

33:57.960 --> 33:59.220
wash up and go to sleep.

34:01.980 --> 34:08.159
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

34:20.550 --> 34:21.280
How did it go?

34:22.230 --> 34:22.760
Here.

34:30.100 --> 34:31.630
These are all the Moon Bugs?

34:33.610 --> 34:34.610
Still not enough.

34:36.360 --> 34:38.760
There should be more at the Ganshan Clinic.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.730
But that old man Jiu

34:41.000 --> 34:42.330
isn't easy to deal with.

34:42.800 --> 34:43.860
Can you handle him?

34:54.230 --> 34:54.830
Oh, right.

34:55.560 --> 34:57.430
I need to make a trip to Yangxi County.

34:57.430 --> 34:58.960
There's a bear demon there.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.230
It's time.

35:02.800 --> 35:03.490
Be careful.

35:04.090 --> 35:04.850
I know.

35:06.320 --> 35:07.230
No matter what,

35:08.190 --> 35:09.190
we still have more than ten days

35:09.190 --> 35:10.850
before the Realm Gate closes.

35:11.090 --> 35:11.620
We have to

35:11.640 --> 35:13.370
be back before that happens.

35:16.360 --> 35:18.180
Got it.

35:22.590 --> 35:24.390
You went to see that woman again?

35:28.610 --> 35:29.870
If you like her so much,

35:30.240 --> 35:32.320
just bring her back to the Carefree Land.

35:32.320 --> 35:33.440
Once the Realm Gate is shut,

35:33.440 --> 35:34.770
she can't leave anyway.

35:35.000 --> 35:36.530
What else can she do but stay

35:37.000 --> 35:38.260
by your side every day?

35:45.760 --> 35:47.000
So indecisive.

35:57.800 --> 35:58.510
My Lady.

35:59.320 --> 35:59.960
My Lady.

35:59.980 --> 36:00.630
My Lady.

36:00.880 --> 36:01.550
My Lady.

36:02.510 --> 36:04.320
-Banxia.
-Wake up, My Lady.

36:04.440 --> 36:05.030
Banxia.

36:05.110 --> 36:05.920
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.

36:05.920 --> 36:06.960
-My Lady.
-Miss Duan.

36:06.960 --> 36:08.030
-Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.
-Miss Duan.

36:08.030 --> 36:08.630
Miss Duan.

36:08.710 --> 36:09.480
Miss Duan.

36:09.480 --> 36:10.710
Why aren't you waking up, My Lady?

36:10.710 --> 36:11.400
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.

36:11.400 --> 36:12.630
-Miss Duan.
-My Lady!

36:12.700 --> 36:14.150
-Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.
-Miss Duan?

36:14.150 --> 36:15.350
-Banxia.
-Miss Duan.

36:15.350 --> 36:17.110
-Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.
-Miss Duan.

36:17.110 --> 36:18.230
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.

36:18.230 --> 36:19.320
-Miss Duan.
-Banxia.

36:19.320 --> 36:20.130
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law.

36:20.130 --> 36:20.840
Miss Duan.

36:21.760 --> 36:22.710
Miss Duan.

36:22.800 --> 36:23.360
Banxia.

36:23.440 --> 36:25.040
Manniang's Cousin-in-Law!

36:25.400 --> 36:26.030
Miss Duan.

36:26.510 --> 36:28.020
Miss Duan.

36:28.190 --> 36:28.840
Banxia.

36:29.230 --> 36:29.880
Banxia.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.110
Wake up.

36:33.070 --> 36:33.710
Banxia.

36:33.730 --> 36:35.000
You can't escape it.

36:35.920 --> 36:36.480
Banxia.

36:42.380 --> 36:43.110
Banxia.

36:46.150 --> 36:46.990
Forget me.

36:51.490 --> 36:52.050
No!

37:04.840 --> 37:05.630
My Lady.

37:06.950 --> 37:07.660
My Lady.

37:08.590 --> 37:09.850
What's wrong, My Lady?

37:10.920 --> 37:12.320
Did you have a nightmare?

37:42.120 --> 37:42.930
Impressive!

37:42.960 --> 37:43.570
Are you alright?

37:43.570 --> 37:44.170
I'm fine.

37:49.400 --> 37:51.130
There are Moon Bugs in this bag.

37:57.480 --> 37:58.340
You're a demon,

37:58.780 --> 37:59.440
aren't you?

38:03.930 --> 38:05.190
I've heard the rumors.

38:05.430 --> 38:06.530
Two demons

38:07.020 --> 38:08.510
posing as demon hunters

38:09.000 --> 38:10.670
are capturing evil demons across the land

38:10.670 --> 38:12.620
and collecting primordial spirits.

38:12.620 --> 38:13.910
They're also buying

38:13.940 --> 38:15.450
Moon Bugs at high prices from other

38:15.450 --> 38:16.330
demon hunters.

38:17.210 --> 38:18.940
At first, I didn't understand,

38:19.630 --> 38:20.960
but the moment I saw you,

38:21.520 --> 38:22.520
it all made sense.

38:27.190 --> 38:28.920
You're from the Carefree Land.

38:29.880 --> 38:31.340
Is the Carefree Herb there

38:31.360 --> 38:32.230
withering?

38:33.960 --> 38:35.090
How do you know that?

38:36.110 --> 38:37.610
If demons can enter the human world,

38:37.610 --> 38:38.360
we humans

38:38.480 --> 38:40.280
can also go to the Carefree Land.

38:40.880 --> 38:41.840
12 years ago,

38:42.150 --> 38:43.230
when the Realm Gate opened wide,

38:43.230 --> 38:45.480
I went to the Underground City to look for my junior brother.

38:45.480 --> 38:47.680
By sheer luck, I got a chance to go there.

39:01.070 --> 39:01.930
I never thought

39:02.360 --> 39:03.590
that outside the human world,

39:03.590 --> 39:04.440
there would be

39:04.440 --> 39:05.280
such a place.

39:05.960 --> 39:06.710
No wonder

39:07.320 --> 39:08.150
every 12 years,

39:08.150 --> 39:09.030
more demons

39:09.070 --> 39:10.200
show up in the world.

39:12.960 --> 39:14.420
That's when I discovered—

39:16.440 --> 39:18.300
the primordial spirits of demons

39:18.710 --> 39:20.310
come from the Carefree Herb.

39:20.710 --> 39:21.910
In the Carefree Land,

39:22.360 --> 39:24.000
they devour primordial spirits to become demons.

39:24.000 --> 39:25.360
And once the Carefree Herb loses its primordial spirit,

39:25.360 --> 39:26.490
it starts to wither.

39:26.670 --> 39:27.230
So,

39:28.030 --> 39:29.150
after a demon dies,

39:29.400 --> 39:30.670
its primordial spirit returns

39:30.670 --> 39:31.870
to the Carefree Herb,

39:32.030 --> 39:33.800
making it take root and sprout again.

39:33.800 --> 39:34.630
It's a cycle

39:35.070 --> 39:36.150
that never ends.

39:36.590 --> 39:38.280
But the primordial spirits that come to the human world

39:38.280 --> 39:39.410
can no longer return

39:39.590 --> 39:41.920
to the Carefree Land after the demons die.

39:42.770 --> 39:43.500
As a result,

39:44.020 --> 39:45.020
the Carefree Land

39:45.190 --> 39:47.190
will eventually run into problems.

39:47.730 --> 39:48.660
All these years,

39:48.970 --> 39:51.300
you've been traveling between the two realms collecting Moon Bugs.

39:51.300 --> 39:52.440
You're actually collecting

39:52.440 --> 39:53.550
the primordial spirits they swallowed,

39:53.550 --> 39:54.320
aren't you?

39:59.230 --> 39:59.840
You're

39:59.840 --> 40:01.320
risking your life.

40:02.630 --> 40:03.530
Mr. Jiu,

40:04.030 --> 40:05.160
you're quite sharp.

40:06.840 --> 40:07.810
Take it then.

40:10.840 --> 40:12.100
Why are you helping me?

40:12.340 --> 40:13.670
Then why did you help me?

40:16.360 --> 40:17.490
Everything happens

40:17.590 --> 40:18.510
for a reason.

40:18.800 --> 40:20.030
Let's just say I'm repaying

40:20.030 --> 40:21.030
your kindness.

40:30.550 --> 40:31.190
Thank you.

40:35.860 --> 40:36.790
I almost forgot.

40:36.960 --> 40:38.620
My son is about to get married.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.600
I need to hurry back to fix the roof.

40:40.660 --> 40:41.440
These dishes are untouched.

40:41.440 --> 40:42.130
Eat them for me.

40:42.130 --> 40:43.130
Don't waste them.

41:22.590 --> 41:23.190
Who?

41:24.840 --> 41:26.420
A man.

41:26.740 --> 41:28.950
He's about this tall,

41:29.850 --> 41:30.920
with thick eyebrows, big eyes,

41:30.920 --> 41:32.000
and a well-shaped nose.

41:32.000 --> 41:33.130
He's very handsome.

41:36.230 --> 41:37.090
I remember now.

41:37.230 --> 41:38.280
There was someone like that.

41:38.280 --> 41:39.540
But he's already left.

41:39.670 --> 41:40.820
When did he leave?

41:40.960 --> 41:42.020
He left last night.

41:42.630 --> 41:44.630
He seemed to be in Guangping on business.

41:44.630 --> 41:45.670
Once it was done,

41:46.030 --> 41:46.800
he left.

41:51.210 --> 41:52.490
Thank you, sir.

41:52.860 --> 41:53.660
It's nothing.

41:54.880 --> 41:57.510
[Jude Hotel]

41:57.670 --> 41:58.480
My Lady,

41:58.500 --> 41:59.960
that man has already left.

42:00.670 --> 42:01.360
Let it go.

42:01.360 --> 42:02.360
Let's go back.

42:03.010 --> 42:04.470
I want to walk around a bit.

42:04.480 --> 42:05.680
You can go back first.

42:06.480 --> 42:07.150
But...

42:08.190 --> 42:09.740
It's fine. Go back.

42:11.770 --> 42:12.610
Alright then.

42:13.070 --> 42:14.200
Take this umbrella.

42:15.510 --> 42:17.730
The sky is overcast. I'll head back first.

42:17.730 --> 42:19.060
Don't stay out too long.

42:19.150 --> 42:19.880
Don't worry.

42:56.080 --> 42:59.000
[Wu's Hoto Noodles]

43:06.850 --> 43:07.800
I'm off now.

43:31.360 --> 43:31.920
My books!

43:32.020 --> 43:32.710
I'll pick them up.

43:32.710 --> 43:33.150
Okay.

43:33.150 --> 43:34.150
I'll pick them up.

44:19.880 --> 44:21.880
Let's go take shelter from the rain.

44:35.820 --> 44:37.230
Last night,

44:37.250 --> 44:38.510
I had that dream again.

44:42.510 --> 44:44.030
Uncle Jiu once told me

44:44.590 --> 44:46.590
that people and things in dreams

44:48.110 --> 44:49.800
are reflections

44:49.950 --> 44:52.400
of what we've seen and experienced in reality.

44:52.400 --> 44:54.260
They don't appear out of nowhere.

44:55.230 --> 44:57.190
But I don't know why

44:57.600 --> 44:59.090
I dream so much.

44:59.480 --> 45:01.230
I always have strange dreams.

45:02.190 --> 45:02.960
They feel so familiar,

45:02.960 --> 45:04.080
yet so unfamiliar.

45:06.150 --> 45:07.480
Like déjà vu,

45:08.130 --> 45:09.540
but with no clear reason.

45:11.620 --> 45:13.700
Like something from a past life.

45:17.320 --> 45:18.320
Mr. Man Ying.

45:20.120 --> 45:21.650
Do you think there's really

45:22.060 --> 45:23.990
Tea of Oblivion in this world?

45:24.690 --> 45:26.690
Because I didn't drink enough of it,

45:26.730 --> 45:27.690
I didn't forget

45:27.710 --> 45:29.640
what happened in my previous life.

45:34.950 --> 45:37.210
Have you really never seen me before?

45:38.070 --> 45:39.870
Do we really not know each other?

45:41.010 --> 45:42.370
Have you ever had

45:42.400 --> 45:43.360
strange dreams

45:43.680 --> 45:44.440
where someone

45:44.440 --> 45:45.770
kept calling your name,

45:45.880 --> 45:47.410
telling you to forget them?

45:48.890 --> 45:50.110
Do you really have no impression

45:50.110 --> 45:50.920
of me at all?

45:52.190 --> 45:52.850
No, I don't.

46:00.690 --> 46:01.720
Alright then.

46:06.910 --> 46:09.300
Maybe I'm having hallucinations again.

46:12.320 --> 46:14.110
Have I ever told you

46:15.600 --> 46:16.800
that my family thinks

46:16.830 --> 46:18.510
I'm mentally ill

46:19.140 --> 46:20.470
and often hallucinate?

46:21.540 --> 46:22.710
Since I was young,

46:23.320 --> 46:24.780
I've been taking medicine

46:25.000 --> 46:27.730
and seeing physicians, but nothing ever worked.

46:29.510 --> 46:30.420
Maybe it's time for me

46:30.420 --> 46:32.110
to take more pills.

46:32.430 --> 46:34.160
I know a little about medicine.

46:34.590 --> 46:35.960
It's not a big issue.

46:37.150 --> 46:38.440
As long as you eat well,

46:39.030 --> 46:39.920
sleep well,

46:40.440 --> 46:41.240
and rest well,

46:42.400 --> 46:44.000
you'll get better with time.

46:45.670 --> 46:47.530
Don't take medicine recklessly.

46:48.090 --> 46:48.690
Okay.

46:51.190 --> 46:52.670
Sorry for the trouble.

46:53.280 --> 46:54.280
I'll be going now.

46:56.310 --> 46:57.470
It's still raining.

47:06.360 --> 47:07.420
Take the umbrella.

47:13.260 --> 47:16.870
♫Just sobered up after a dream, sighing for my life♫

47:17.010 --> 47:19.880
♫In this desolate mortal world♫

47:20.570 --> 47:22.910
♫The other side sees fantasies fading into obscurity♫

47:22.930 --> 47:26.700
♫Is it a blessing or a calamity?♫

47:29.050 --> 47:31.000
♫I'm all alone♫

47:31.020 --> 47:32.900
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

47:32.920 --> 47:35.580
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

47:36.290 --> 47:38.700
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

47:38.720 --> 47:46.280
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

47:40.410 --> 47:41.070
Are you really not

47:41.070 --> 47:42.530
coming back to Guangping?

47:44.880 --> 47:46.010
It's a long journey.

47:46.400 --> 47:47.360
Hard to travel back and forth.

47:46.600 --> 47:48.590
♫If there were no regrets♫

47:48.360 --> 47:49.230
I won't come back.

47:48.680 --> 47:50.670
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

47:50.690 --> 47:53.680
♫To illuminate the world?♫

47:53.630 --> 47:54.710
All right.

47:54.040 --> 47:57.680
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

47:58.280 --> 48:01.930
♫Before daybreak♫

47:59.710 --> 48:01.030
I wish you

48:01.800 --> 48:03.030
a safe journey,

48:02.020 --> 48:03.960
♫May you have no regrets♫

48:03.800 --> 48:05.190
a smooth life,

48:03.980 --> 48:05.550
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

48:05.580 --> 48:09.420
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

48:06.320 --> 48:07.980
freedom from fear and sorrow,

48:08.590 --> 48:09.800
and joy that lasts.

48:09.810 --> 48:12.040
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

48:12.090 --> 48:13.950
♫If we luck out♫

48:13.970 --> 48:19.740
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

48:15.030 --> 48:15.630
Thank you.

48:21.780 --> 48:23.710
♫If there were no regrets♫

48:23.740 --> 48:25.740
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

48:25.760 --> 48:28.350
♫To illuminate the world?♫

48:29.130 --> 48:32.820
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

48:33.490 --> 48:37.190
♫Before daybreak♫

48:37.210 --> 48:38.900
♫May you have no regrets♫

48:38.940 --> 48:40.280
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

48:40.310 --> 48:44.540
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

48:44.930 --> 48:47.280
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

48:47.310 --> 48:48.940
♫If we luck out♫

48:48.990 --> 48:56.100
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫
